e-height:1.25;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">Explanation:</span><span style="color:#2d3436;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Inter&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;We convert the entered character to lowercase and check if it matches 'a', 'e', 'i', 'o', or 'u'. If it does, we print 'vowel', otherwise 'Consonant'.</span></p><h1 id="h.d8duqgr70zsc" style="padding-top:24pt;margin:0;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:700;padding-left:0;font-size:18pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.25;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Lexend&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#2c3e50;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:18pt;font-family:&quot;Lexend&quot;;font-style:normal">Question 6: Print all numbers between 1 to N</span></h1><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#2d3436;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Inter&quot;;line-height:1.25;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#2d3436;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Inter&quot;;font-style:normal">using System;</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#2d3436;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Inter&quot;;line-height:1.25;orphans:2;widows:2;height:12pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#2d3436;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Inter&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#2d3436;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Inter&quot;;line-height:1.25;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#2d3436;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Inter&quot;;font-style:normal">namespace Assignment3</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#2d3436;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Inter&quot;;line-height:1.15;height:12pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#2d